Section 3.
That there shall be raised by General Tax Levy on the total assessed valuation of the City of
Cheyenne, Wyoming for fiscal year 2019, in accordance with State Statutes:
General Fund
 $          5,398,200
Providing that said amount does not exceed eight (8.0) mills on City assessed valuations as
provided by law.
